Artwork
-------

The face and icon artwork was generated with ChatGPT image generation from
prompts written by the project's author, and is released under the same
license as the rest of the project (Apache-2.0). It covers:

  - the eleven face portraits and the app icons cut from them:
      ios/Marlow/Marlow/Assets.xcassets/MarlowFace*.imageset/
      ios/Marlow/Marlow/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon*.appiconset/
      web/public/faces/ (marlow-*.jpg, icon-*.jpg, app-*-512.png,
        app-*-maskable-512.png)
  - the web app icons, which are crops of face 1:
      web/public/icon-192.png, icon-512.png, icon-maskable-512.png
  - marlow-icon-square.png (the original of face 1), and its README copy,
      docs/images/marlow-portrait-400.jpg


Third-party data
----------------

server/data/places.tsv.gz

  Place names, coordinates, populations and time zones in this file come from
  GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org), licensed under Creative Commons
  Attribution 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

  The data has been modified: filtered to populated places in Canada, the
  United States, Mexico and the United Kingdom, and reduced to name,
  coordinates, country, region, population and time zone
  (scripts/build_places.py).

  Downloaded 2026-10-13 and 2026-10-14.

(server/data/NOTICE stays beside the data file and carries the same text.)

tests/fixtures/weather/

  Recorded responses from public weather and routing services, used only by
  the test suite: Open-Meteo (CC BY 4.0, https://open-meteo.com), MET Norway
  (CC BY 4.0 and the Norwegian Licence for Open Government Data),
  Environment and Climate Change Canada (Open Government Licence - Canada),
  the US National Weather Service (US government work, public domain), and
  the OSRM routing service, whose road data is (c) OpenStreetMap contributors,
  available under the Open Database License (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright).


